CHANGES IN VERSION v1.4.0
------------------------

NEW DATA

    o SUMMARY: 11,939 signatures and 147 experiments without signatures
      from 1,847 studies (v1.3.1: 7,425, 0 and 1,246)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_metaphlan.gmt: 8444 rows (+3161)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_metaphlan_exact.gmt: 8438 rows (+3156)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_ncbi.gmt: 8444 rows (+3161)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_ncbi_exact.gmt: 8438 rows (+3156)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_taxname.gmt: 8444 rows (+3161)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_taxname_exact.gmt: 8438 rows (+3156)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_mixed_metaphlan.gmt: 11939 rows (+4574)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_mixed_ncbi.gmt: 11939 rows (+4574)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_mixed_taxname.gmt: 11939 rows (+4574)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_metaphlan.gmt: 5417 rows (+2069)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_metaphlan_exact.gmt: 5417 rows (+2069)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_ncbi.gmt: 5417 rows (+2069)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_ncbi_exact.gmt: 5417 rows (+2069)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_taxname.gmt: 5417 rows (+2069)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_taxname_exact.gmt: 5417 rows (+2069)

NEW FIELDS

    o Study columns Curation method (Manual or Machine), Curation
      protocol (methods page for machine-curated studies),
      submittedBy and submissionDate (first revision of the Study
      page), Review state and Quality control tag

QUALITY CONTROL

    o Removed studies tagged "Retracted paper"
    o Removed studies whose Review state is "Incorrect"
    o Removed studies with neither a valid PMID nor a valid DOI
    o Removed signatures with no taxa resolved to an NCBI Taxonomy ID
    o Added experiments without signatures, which record a negative
      taxonomic result and alpha diversity, from reviewed studies. They
      have empty signature columns in full_dump.csv
    o DOIs normalized to the 10.xxxx/... form. Studies whose DOI was
      a doi.org URL were previously removed; they are now included

TAXONOMY

    o NCBI taxonomy from ncbi-taxon-db 2026.11.1 (NCBI taxdump of
      1 November 2026)

CHANGES IN VERSION v1.3.1
------------------------

NEW DATA

    o full_dump.csv: 8153 rows (734 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_metaphlan_exact.gmt: 5282 rows (194 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_metaphlan.gmt: 5283 rows (1408 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_ncbi_exact.gmt: 5282 rows (194 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_ncbi.gmt: 5283 rows (1408 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_taxname_exact.gmt: 5282 rows (194 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_genus_taxname.gmt: 5283 rows (1408 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_mixed_metaphlan.gmt: 7365 rows (545 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_mixed_ncbi.gmt: 7365 rows (545 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_mixed_taxname.gmt: 7365 rows (545 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_metaphlan_exact.gmt: 3348 rows (265 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_metaphlan.gmt: 3348 rows (265 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_ncbi_exact.gmt: 3348 rows (265 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_ncbi.gmt: 3348 rows (265 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_taxname_exact.gmt: 3348 rows (265 removed by QC)
    o bugsigdb_signatures_species_taxname.gmt: 3348 rows (265 removed by QC)

QUALITY CONTROL

    o Removed signatures with invalid or missing BSDB ID, experiment,
      signature, or curated date
    o Removed signatures with missing study, study design, condition,
      reviewer, group names, group 0 name, group 1 definition, EFO ID or source
    o Removed signatures with invalid PMID, DOI URL, year, or group sample sizes
    o Removed signatures with invalid significance threshold (must be
      between 0 and 1) or LDA score (must be between 0 and 20)
    o Removed signatures where abundance in Group 1 is not "increased" or
      "decreased"
    o Removed signatures with incomplete state
